  m_text: 'HOW TO PLAY


    Move with W A S D, arrows, or the left stick.

    Tap
    or hold LEFT CLICK / A for a hover pulse.

    Drive through the ball for an
    air-hockey push.

    Dash with RIGHT CLICK, SHIFT, right trigger, or B.

    Pulse
    and Dash share three recharging energy cells.

    Stay on your half of the pitch.

    First
    team to score 5 goals wins!'
